{"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Grouping-APIs","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/DataFrame\/groupBy(_:)"],"title":"Grouping APIs"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tabular analytical queries frequently demand grouping by categorical columns and computing summary statistics (mean, sum, variance, min, max, count) across numerical dimensions. "},{"code":"SwiftDataFrame","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" provides SIMD-accelerated grouping algorithms optimized for Apple Silicon unified memory."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"1. Basic GroupBy Aggregation","anchor":"1-Basic-GroupBy-Aggregation","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftDataFrame","","let df = try DataFrame(columns: [","    TypedColumn<String>(name: \"category\", values: [\"Tech\", \"Finance\", \"Tech\", \"Healthcare\", \"Finance\"]),","    TypedColumn<Double>(name: \"revenue\", values: [120.5, 340.0, 210.0, 95.0, 450.5]),","    TypedColumn<Double>(name: \"growth\", values: [0.15, 0.08, 0.22, 0.05, 0.12])","])","","\/\/ Compute mean revenue and sum of growth grouped by category","let grouped = try df.groupBy(\"category\")","    .aggregate([","        \"revenue\": .mean,","        \"growth\": .sum","    ])","","grouped.debugPrint()"]},{"type":"heading","text":"2. Multi-Column Grouping","level":2,"anchor":"2-Multi-Column-Grouping"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can group by multiple categorical dimensions simultaneously:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let multiGrouped = try df.groupBy([\"region\", \"product_tier\"])","    .aggregate([","        \"sales\": .sum,","        \"discount\": .mean,","        \"quantity\": .count","    ])"]},{"type":"heading","text":"3. Performance & Memory Efficiency","level":2,"anchor":"3-Performance--Memory-Efficiency"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Single-Pass Hash Accumulation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Group indices are computed using contiguous hash tables, avoiding unnecessary row permutations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"vDSP Vector Reductions","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Numerical summaries within each group are calculated using Apple Accelerate SIMD routines ("},{"code":"vDSP_sveD","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"vDSP_meanvD","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"High-Performance GroupBy & Vectorized Aggregations","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftDataFrame"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/AggregationsAndGroupBy"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Master high-throughput columnar grouping, multi-key aggregations, and window transformations in SwiftDataFrame."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/aggregationsandgroupby"]}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftDataFrame/documentation/SwiftDataFrame/DataFrame/groupBy(_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a "},{"code":"GroupedDataFrame","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for aggregation."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/dataframe\/groupby(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupBy"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"...) -> "},{"kind":